<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>GPS kuzatuvga rozilik</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; background: #0f172a; color: #e2e8f0; margin: 0; display: flex; min-height: 100vh; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 1rem; }
    .card { background: #1e293b; padding: 1.75rem; border-radius: 12px; max-width: 480px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.4); }
    h1 { font-size: 1.3rem; }
    p { line-height: 1.5; font-size: .95rem; }
    .who { color: #93c5fd; font-weight: 600; }
    button { width: 100%; margin-top: 1.5rem; padding: .85rem; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; background: #16a34a; color: #fff; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
    .note { font-size: .8rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 1rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <form class="card" method="POST" action="/consent/<%= token %>">
    <h1>GPS kuzatuvga rozilik</h1>
    <p>
      Hurmatli <span class="who"><%= employee.name %></span>,
      <% if (employee.position) { %>(<%= employee.position %>)<% } %>
      kompaniya sizni <strong>ish vaqtida GPS joylashuv</strong> orqali
      kuzatishni so'ramoqda.
    </p>
    <p>
      Buning maqsadi — <strong>korrupsiya va qoida buzilishlarini nazorat qilish</strong>.
      Kuzatuv faqat siz rozilik berganingizdan keyin boshlanadi va kuzatuv
      sahifasi ochiq bo'lganida ekranda doimo <strong>"GPS kuzatuv FAOL"</strong>
      degan belgi ko'rinib turadi. Hech qanday ilova o'rnatish shart emas.
    </p>
    <button type="submit">Roziman</button>
    <div class="note">
      Rozilik bermasangiz, joylashuvingiz yig'ilmaydi. Bu rozilik vaqti
      bilan birga qayd etiladi.
    </div>
  </form>
</body>
</html>
